# Record stand (issue 172, front faces north): a novelty portable record player in a pink suitcase. The front faces north: a thin north strip of the case with butter latches; the cream deck with its platter and tonearm faces the player; the lid is hinged at the back (south, the wall side) and stands open toward the wall, its lining with a speaker grille facing north. 16x16.
size: 16x16
